# Club surfaces config (P4-C)

Expose **`site_surfaces`** (admin / marketing / portal) from tenant config in Super Admin and enforce maintenance when disabled.

**Doc SoT:** this file · **Nano spec:** `TEMP/p4/p4-c-club-surfaces.md` (historical local scratch `p4-c-club-surfaces.md`; not fresh-clone authority — see docs/audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/psr-2b-temp-authority-inventory.yaml) v1.0

**Status (2026-06-21):** doc 9.9 · **P4-C complete** (12/12 nanos · SF specs green)

---

## What P4-C actually delivers (honest scope)

| Deliverable           | Detail                                                                |
| --------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Read path (new)**   | `read-tenant-site-surfaces.ts` — `tenant_config.site_surfaces` → DTO  |
| **Super Admin UI**    | Sites tab badges (`data-platform-surface`) + URLs (extends P2 tab)    |
| **Public context**    | `GET /public/tenant-context` includes `siteSurfaces` for guest shells |
| **Maintenance**       | Marketing layout → `MaintenancePage` when `marketing: false`          |
| **Pre-P2 (not P4-C)** | `sites/check` portal probe · URL list in Sites tab                    |

**Gap G3:** closed with read path + badges + SF specs.

---

## Executive summary

| Layer              | P4-C delivers                                          |
| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| **Seed (exists)**  | Provision saga writes `tenant_config.site_surfaces`    |
| **Super Admin UI** | Sites tab shows admin / marketing / portal flags       |
| **Read API**       | BFF exposes surfaces on club detail                    |
| **Maintenance**    | Disabled marketing → maintenance page (pattern P2-A)   |
| **Health**         | `sites/check` includes portal + marketing reachability |

---

## Goals

| Goal                | Detail                                              |
| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| Observable surfaces | Platform ops sees which surfaces enabled per club   |
| v1 control          | Read-only badges; toggle via PATCH deferred to v1.1 |
| URL display         | Sites tab shows 3 URLs from provision response      |
| Denali safety       | No package edits                                    |

## Non-goals (P4-C v1)

- Per-surface custom domains (P2-D domains tab covers custom hosts)
- DNS automation for portal subdomain
- Feature flags per surface beyond boolean config

---

## Industry alignment

| Pattern                      | Source                   | P4-C mapping                        |
| ---------------------------- | ------------------------ | ----------------------------------- |
| **Multi-storefront toggles** | Shopify sales channels   | Enable/disable marketing vs portal  |
| **Maintenance mode**         | P2-A gateway pattern     | Disabled surface → maintenance stub |
| **Tenant config JSONB**      | SaaS feature flags in DB | `site_surfaces` payload             |

---

## Config shape (frozen)

```json
{
  "admin": true,
  "marketing": true,
  "portal": true
}
```

| Key         | Default | Notes                              |
| ----------- | ------- | ---------------------------------- |
| `admin`     | `true`  | Operator panel — cannot disable v1 |
| `marketing` | `true`  | Public catalog host                |
| `portal`    | `true`  | Registration host                  |

Seeded by [`seed-tenant-site-surfaces-config.ts`](../../apps/api/src/platform/seed-tenant-site-surfaces-config.ts) on provision.

---

## Super Admin UI (P4-C-N-004)

Sites tab (`platform-club-detail`) — extend existing Sites panel:

```text
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Sites                                    │
│ Admin     ● enabled   alborz.admin...   │
│ Marketing ● enabled   shop.alborz...    │
│ Portal    ● enabled   alborz.portal...  │
│ [Check health]                           │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

v1: read-only badges · v1.1 (optional): PATCH toggle via platform API

