## Code anchors

| Anchor           | Path                                                 |
| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| Read + normalize | `apps/api/src/platform/read-tenant-site-surfaces.ts` |

When `DATABASE_URL` is unset (memory harness / static dev tenants), read returns `DEFAULT_TENANT_SITE_SURFACES` without Prisma — same pattern as operator PATCH tenant-status skip in P4-A.
| Seed | `apps/api/src/platform/seed-tenant-site-surfaces-config.ts` |
| Provision | `apps/api/src/platform/provision-tenant-saga.ts` |
| Public context | `apps/api/src/tenant/tenant-branding.service.ts` (`siteSurfaces`) |
| Sites check | `apps/api/src/platform/check-tenant-sites-health.ts` |
| Club detail UI | `apps/web/src/platform/club-detail/tab-sites.tsx` |
| Marketing gate | `apps/marketing/src/tenant/resolve-marketing-site-surfaces.ts` |
| Maintenance | `apps/marketing/src/platform/maintenance-page.tsx` |

